    "Your changes still waiting to sync are sent first. Then the vault is removed from this Mac and you stop receiving its changes. Its owner and the other members keep it; only the owner can share it with you again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your changes still waiting to sync are sent first. Then the vault is removed from this Mac and you stop receiving its changes. Its owner and the other members keep it; only the owner can share it with you again."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prima vengono inviate le tue modifiche ancora in attesa. Poi il vault viene rimosso da questo Mac e smetti di riceverne le modifiche. Il proprietario e gli altri membri lo conservano; solo il proprietario può condividerlo di nuovo con te."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your login could not be saved in the Keychain; you'll need to log in again next time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
